  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two doors",
      "items": [
        "4455 carries every action that spends money or sends mail",
        "4456 exists so a deployed site can report a visit, and nothing more",
        "4455 currently binds 0.0.0.0; it should bind localhost and reach you over Tailscale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The work loop",
      "items": [
        "Nothing is event-driven: a 30-second tick is the only self-starter",
        "One task runs at a time, as a conversation of up to 25 steps",
        "A budget stop saves that conversation, so the retry resumes instead of paying twice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Choke points",
      "items": [
        "llm.ts: every model call to DeepSeek, and where the daily and monthly caps bite",
        "actions.ts: everything outward-facing waits here for your approval",
        "publish.ts: a deploy that would ship an API key stops and names the file"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What is missing",
      "items": [
        "No step verifies an agent's work before the task is filed as done",
        "No git tool: agents cannot commit or open a pull request, so you do it",
        "A task's conversation only grows; one spent 2.59M prompt tokens over 25 calls"
      ]
    }
  ]
